Subject: [PATCH] apply native TX backpressure at shared descriptor ownership

Reserve a descriptor before consuming a native Ethernet skb. Keep pool
allocation, stop/wake and active netdev membership under the existing
pool lock. Completion and unused reservations return capacity through
the same release path. STA direct TX needs an ordinary qdisc for retry.

